  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt half the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water and vegetable stock powder. Bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous, stir to combine, then cover with a lid and remove from the heat. Set aside until water has absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239cfc5233ff27ac0a532/step-8ed6d000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239cfc5233ff27ac0a532/step-ec723f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine carrot couscous, tomato, rocket leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Finish the couscous in the saucepan to save on washing up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239cfc5233ff27ac0a532/step-f782ca20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rocket and tomato couscous salad and haloumi between plates.\n• Spoon remaining dukkah from pan over haloumi. Drizzle over garlic sauce and crumble over fetta to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239cfc5233ff27ac0a532/step-4aebf130.jpg"
    }
  ]
